{"id":"final","lemma":"final","pos":"adj","rank":319,"glosses":["final (last, ultimate)","final (conclusive, decisive)"],"ipa":"/fiˈnal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"finales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-final.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto es el final.","en":"This is the end.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442012"},{"text":"A finales de agosto, las fuerzas aliadas tomaron París.","en":"In late August, the Allied forces captured Paris.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693527"},{"text":"Al final lo dejé.","en":"I finally gave up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/532179"},{"text":"Voy a prepararme para los exámenes finales esta tarde.","en":"I'm going to get ready for the final exams this afternoon.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692914"},{"text":"El final se precipitó.","en":"The end came suddenly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301877"}]}